{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测经Redis CONFIG SET cron目录疑似持久化。对应需求：持久化。官方：Potential Redis CONFIG SET Cron Directory Persistence (RedisRaider)。","from":"now-9m","index":["logs-network_traffic.redis*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】经Redis CONFIG SET cron目录疑似持久化","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\n经Redis CONFIG SET cron目录疑似持久化\n\n### 为何重要\n在重启或登录后保持立足点\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、进程/网络字段与时间窗。\n2. 核对是否符合变更窗口与已知业务工具。\n3. 关联同主机或同账号前后同类告警。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离相关主机或账号并排查落地与外连。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警。\n","references":["https://securitylabs.datadoghq.com/articles/redisraider-mining-campaign/","https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1053/003/","https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1496/"],"risk_score":73,"rule_id":"29e57265-d358-420a-b1cd-845e8a1fd70d","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 接入边界或主机网络日志（Packetbeat、防火墙、云流量等，按规则数据源）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","severity":"high","tags":["操作系统: 网络","主题: 持久化","来源: 默认","对应需求: 持久化"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"eql","query":"network where data_stream.dataset == \"network_traffic.redis\" and\n  network_traffic.redis.query like~ \"*CONFIG SET dir*\" and\n  (\n    network_traffic.redis.query like~ \"*/etc/cron*\" or\n    network_traffic.redis.query like~ \"*/var/spool/cron*\"\n  )\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1053","name":"Scheduled Task/Job","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1053/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1053.003","name":"Cron","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1053/003/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0003","name":"Persistence","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0003/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1496","name":"Resource Hijacking","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1496/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0040","name":"Impact","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0040/"}}],"false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"network_traffic","version":"*"}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","source.ip","destination.ip","destination.port","network.protocol","network.direction","tls.server.x509.subject.common_name","dns.question.name","host.name","user.name","message"]},"version":2,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now"}
